MEASURED AT HEAD, 2026-09-06 (global rail 6 — every claim below is a command I ran, not a description I trusted). The row's description is ACCURATE on every point I checked.

THE GAP IS REAL AND EXACTLY AS DESCRIBED. deploy-command.ts:91-99:
```
export function productionDeployPorts(): DeployPorts {
  return Object.freeze({
    docker: nodeDockerRunner,
    releaseDecision: () => null,
    ssh: nodeSshRunner,
    target: () => null,      // <- :96, this row's subject
    transfer: nodeImageTransfer,
